#: landing/templates/index.html:74
msgid "Reduce commute emmissions"
msgstr ""

#: landing/templates/index.html:75
msgid ""
"Fewer cars driving the same routes means lower commute emissions and a more "
"climate-friendly campus community."
msgstr ""

#: landing/templates/index.html:79
msgid ""
"LUT Kyyti is a LUT University-funded initiative that helps its community "
"reduce commute-related emissions by sharing rides."
msgstr ""

#: landing/templates/index.html:80
