#: landing/templates/index.html:94
msgid ""
"Drivers post rides they are already planning to make. Passengers can search "
"for suitable rides and request to join. They can also post ride requests. "
"The driver and passenger then agree on the practical details."
msgstr ""

#: landing/templates/index.html:98
msgid ""
"No. LUT Kyyti is not a taxi, bus, or transport provider. It is a platform "
"that helps members of the LUT/LAB community find others travelling in the "
"same direction."
msgstr ""

#: landing/templates/index.html:102
msgid ""
"Using the platform is free. Any cost sharing between driver and passenger, "
"such as fuel costs, is agreed directly between the users. LUT Kyyti does not "
